  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: Targets .NET 10 and .NET 11, with Native AOT support for both. Append and insert records in existing XLSX files with the same single/range and sync/async method families as CSV. Preserves supported workbook content through validated staged replacement, with streaming row rewriting and existing date-system/style indexes. Supports Transitional and Strict plain tabular workbooks; unsafe reference features are rejected. Includes LINQ queries, CSV/XLSX exports, Native AOT, and a BCL-only runtime. API changes remain possible.",
